{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0952ed2213c75d73c140f5f4dbec6ea41ea6285f606d77e40020ba0e89c3759a","ja":"今日はみんなで野外公演……！\nくぅ～、リハーサルから気合い入っちゃうよ！","zh":"今天是大家一起的野外公演……！\n唔～，从彩排开始就干劲十足啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"36cd46ad146cce41210c3789ef55bf7484a5683ccdfcc7c6deb3f21b47481427","ja":"うん！　気持ちいいお天気だし、\n思いっきり踊っちゃおうネ～！　それっ♪","zh":"嗯！天气这么好，\n让我们尽情跳舞吧～！来吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"29083f797a4e56bfa09e923e1329ea84fe746db391d769d4e61510e421842e84","ja":"おっ、いいステップじゃん？\nでもアタシだって負けてないよ！　よっと！","zh":"哦，舞步不错嘛？\n但我也不会输哦！　嘿哟！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"345d507ccf86a76ac1996425163d384e5a983dbc97ae53c3abc72e449e50d613","ja":"さすがアユムだネ！　なんだか、\nダンスで勝負したくなってきたヨ！","zh":"不愧是步！总觉得，突然想和你比比舞技了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e9ad3136c62dc1897b9210832fce2dc9ef5982840aab6161b8619cbfe09ff4d3","ja":"ダンス勝負か……いいね、受けて立つよ！\nエレナが相手なら本気で……。","zh":"跳舞比赛吗……好啊，放马过来吧！\n如果对手是艾蕾娜，我可要认真了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b6f40260987cd9681e570691d64d0c308bd156ba4fe83c72052668c988115e12","ja":"ひっ！？","zh":"咿！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f3d69ec0591ef40c1ce5c7642b02cdddbea796d527d8a1fbee9c4d5bc170442b","ja":"どうしたのアユム？　\n急に止まっちゃって。","zh":"怎么了，昴？\n突然停下来了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6d1c9c9fcc2ce8c39c73e00cbade51b6543e497256c1abb7dddf4daff9545468","ja":"ま、ま、マイガーっ！？\nヘっ、ヘビがっ、アタシの足元に……っ！！　","zh":"天、天、天哪——！？  \n蛇、蛇在我脚边……！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e7a910cbf3ebb32524648df5f9b90d3f6d41a6afc79277002ddd02c1ba9294ff","ja":"こ、こういう時はダンスで追い払っ……！\nああっ！？　足に巻き付かないで……ガクッ。","zh":"这、这种时候就用舞蹈把它赶走……！\n啊啊！？别缠到脚上……咕。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"126499b81cdbea9bedbeb42004b5131a8cc260d191965cda7efb6fbd1e09f153","ja":"あ、アユムー！？","zh":"啊，步——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0c765dfd27ed9f1a3bd3a1a1928da2c077874aab2de7c3200393ec570e2aa542","ja":"ヘビさん、今はしっしっ！　ダヨー！","zh":"小蛇，现在快走开！的说——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_848.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5efde7deb4dcec547bbfcc9af74dc510cd6a93f54ec46328cfcaf6e1bb930024","ja":"アユムはしばらくこのままカナ……。\nダンス勝負は……ワタシの勝ち……？","zh":"步暂时会一直这样吧……  \n舞蹈对决……是我赢了……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
